# Pilots (WFCrewPilot): said along with the common lines.

wf-crew-bark-pilot-struck-1 = Course correction received, Boss!
wf-crew-bark-pilot-struck-2 = Thank you, Boss! Heading adjusted.
wf-crew-bark-pilot-struck-3 = Copy that, Boss. Loud and clear.

wf-crew-bark-pilot-greet-boss-1 = Holding steady, Boss.
wf-crew-bark-pilot-greet-boss-2 = Helm's yours whenever you want it, Boss.

wf-crew-bark-pilot-idle-1 = Holding station. Holding. ...Still holding.
wf-crew-bark-pilot-idle-2 = Fuel's fine. Thrust's fine. I'm fine.
wf-crew-bark-pilot-idle-3 = I could thread this hull through a ring dock blindfolded. Not that anyone asks.
wf-crew-bark-pilot-idle-4 = Somebody left a coffee ring on my console again.

wf-crew-bark-pilot-jump-1 = Spinning up the drive. Everyone strap in!
wf-crew-bark-pilot-jump-2 = Jumping. Try not to touch anything.

wf-crew-bark-pilot-arrived-1 = Jump complete. Nobody clap, it's unprofessional.
wf-crew-bark-pilot-arrived-2 = We're out. Taking a nav fix.
